                                                     3 *
                                                     4 *   Miscellaneous-instruction-extensions facility 4 instruction tests
                                                     5 *   for RXY-c encoded:
                                                     6 *
                                                     7 *   E360  LXAB  - load indexed address (shift left 0)          [RXY-c]
                                                     8 *   E361  LLXAB - load logical indexed address (shift left 0)  [RXY-c]
                                                     9 *   E362  LXAH  - load indexed address (shift left 1)          [RXY-c]
                                                    10 *   E363  LLXAH - load logical indexed address (shift left 1)  [RXY-c]
                                                    11 *   E364  LXAF  - load indexed address (shift left 2)          [RXY-c]
                                                    12 *   E365  LLXAF - load logical indexed address (shift left 2)  [RXY-c]
                                                    13 *   E366  LXAG  - load indexed address (shift left 3)          [RXY-c]
                                                    14 *   E367  LLXAG - load logical indexed address (shift left 3)  [RXY-c]
                                                    15 *   E368  LXAQ  - load indexed address (shift left 4)          [RXY-c]
                                                    16 *   E369  LLXAQ - load logical indexed address (shift left 4)  [RXY-c]
