                                                    21 ***********************************************************************
                                                    22 *
                                                    23 *        basic instruction tests
                                                    24 *
                                                    25 ***********************************************************************
                                                    26 *  This program tests proper functioning of the Miscellaneous
                                                    27 *  Instruction Extensions facility 4 RXY-c load indexed address
                                                    28 *  and load logical indexed address instructions.
                                                    29 *  Exceptions are not tested.
                                                    30 *
                                                    31 *  PLEASE NOTE that the tests are very SIMPLE TESTS designed to catch
                                                    32 *  obvious coding errors.  None of the tests are thorough.  They are
                                                    33 *  NOT designed to test all aspects of any of the instructions.
                                                    34 *
                                                    35 ***********************************************************************
                                                    36 *
                                                    37 *  *Testcase mie4-IndexAddress
                                                    38 *  *
                                                    39 *  *   Miscellaneous-instruction-extensions facility 4 instruction
                                                    40 *  *   tests for RXY-c encoded:
                                                    41 *  *
                                                    42 *  * E360  LXAB  - load indexed address (shift left 0)         [RXY-c]
                                                    43 *  * E361  LLXAB - load logical indexed address (shift left 0) [RXY-c]
                                                    44 *  * E362  LXAH  - load indexed address (shift left 1)         [RXY-c]
                                                    45 *  * E363  LLXAH - load logical indexed address (shift left 1) [RXY-c]
                                                    46 *  * E364  LXAF  - load indexed address (shift left 2)         [RXY-c]
                                                    47 *  * E365  LLXAF - load logical indexed address (shift left 2) [RXY-c]
                                                    48 *  * E366  LXAG  - load indexed address (shift left 3)         [RXY-c]
                                                    49 *  * E367  LLXAG - load logical indexed address (shift left 3) [RXY-c]
                                                    50 *  * E368  LXAQ  - load indexed address (shift left 4)         [RXY-c]
                                                    51 *  * E369  LLXAQ - load logical indexed address (shift left 4) [RXY-c]
                                                    52 *  *
                                                    53 *  *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    54 *  *   #  This tests only the basic function of the instruction.
                                                    55 *  *   #  Exceptions are NOT tested.
